# Testing

- Test behavior, not private implementation details.
- Use fakes for use-case unit tests. Use `work_board_test` for persistence/e2e.
- Never reset or destroy non-test databases.
- Mock only at true boundaries (HTTP, Redis, Prisma in unit tests).
- Skill: `.cursor/skills/write-tests/SKILL.md`.
